## Acceptance criteria

- [ ] `AgentRequest` (server and web) is the discriminated union above with kinds `start-run | open-run | open-graph | propose-graph | refresh`; `open_start_run` still queues `start-run` requests unchanged and its tests pass.
- [ ] A new request replaces a pending one only of the same terminal and kind; `refresh` requests never replace, are listed without `terminalId`, expire 10 s after creation, and `POST /api/agent-requests/:id/ack` returns 404 for them.
- [ ] `GET /api/internal/tools` lists `open_run` (`runId` required) and `refresh_ui`.
- [ ] `open_run { runId }` → text `Opened run <id> in graph-manager.` and a queued `{ kind: "open-run", runId }`; unknown/invalid run → `unknown run <id>`; terminal outside a workspace → `this terminal is not inside a graph-manager workspace`; nothing queued on error.
